<title>USA: Cuba Gooding wins Oscar for best supporting actor.</title>
<headline>Cuba Gooding wins Oscar for best supporting actor.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cuba Gooding Jr won the Academy Award on Monday for best supporting actor for his role in &quot;Jerry Maguire.&quot;</p>
</text>
